/blob-report/
/playwright/.cache/

# Agent worktrees. The harness creates a nested git worktree here when a
# subagent is given its own isolated checkout; it is another working tree,
# not project content, and committing it would vendor a second copy of the
# repo. Scoped to `worktrees/` rather than all of `.claude/`, which is where
# repo-level skills would legitimately live.
/.claude/worktrees/
